### New findings

- MEDIUM `store.rs:950-955` ÔÇö settle deletes differing dest before `verified_source`. Absent digest + existing dest = file deleted then `RegistryUnreachable`. Verify store before destructive clear.
- MEDIUM `store.rs:358-392` ÔÇö bare `out.bin` always refused: empty parent `""` fails `canonicalize`. Map empty ÔåÆ `.`.
- LOW `store.rs:995-1000` ÔÇö tmp `tmp-<prefix>-<pid>` not unique: same-pid concurrent different-dests same-parent collide; sweep can delete in-flight tmp. Add counter/random.
- LOW `store.rs:253,500,528` ÔÇö `make_readonly`/`set_permissions` follow symlinks; settle `AlreadyPresent` has no pre-chmod re-check. Local racer gets chmod-on-target.
- LOW `store.rs:313-321` ÔÇö sweep uses `is_ascii_hexdigit` (accepts `A-F`) but link site always lowercase; deletes user `tmp-DEADBEEF-123`. Restrict to `0-9a-f`.
- LOW `store.rs:445` ÔÇö `hash_streaming(tmp)` I/O error leaves tmp (only mismatch cleans). Next sweep heals, but inconsistent.
- LOW `store.rs:528-545` ÔÇö replacing linked dest clears store-entry bit via shared inode; old entry left writable.
- LOW `store.rs:1433-1452` ÔÇö test-only `remove_temp` uses `is_dir`/`metadata` (follow symlinks), can chmod outside tree via `linked` fixture. Use `symlink_metadata`.


